+/*
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+ * Copyright (c) Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. 2021-2025. All rights reserved.
+ * Description: ubagg statistics
+ * Author: Zhang Dianhao
+ * Create: 2026-04-05
